  "findings": [
    "At 30 minutes, clean developing entries rise from 10 to 21 and developing reentry entries fall from 12 to 6; all four tracked foundations earn actual supporting qualification rather than only two.",
    "At 45 minutes, clean developing entries rise from 68 to 70 and developing reentry falls from 9 to 7. The bodyweight-squat qualification milestone moves one week later.",
    "At 60 minutes, all tracked cycle endpoints remain complete; clean developing entries rise from 112 to 114, but one reduced return occurs versus zero before. This is a reported scheduling tradeoff, not uniformly improved recurrence."
  ],
